# ─── EXECUTION MODEL ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# KRONOS can be executed in three modes:
#
# MODE_INTERPRET: Read this file. Understand the structure. No runtime needed.
# MODE_SIMULATE:  Run kronos_sim.py (included in programs/). Python 3.x required.
# MODE_EXECUTE:   Requires field-based substrate (quantum/analog). Future work.
#
# To run simulation: python3 programs/kronos_sim.py
# Expected output:   KRONOS.HRM is FUNCTIONALLY COHERENT.
# Expected assert:   ω ≈ 263/97 within ε = 0.01
#
# ─── THE PROGRAM ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

ω:->Φπε^(%/N^Τ/Ρ)
RUN:Φπε
ΓΛΣΔΩΨ
->(?)
Θn(ΨΩ)β^X-Λ^%λ/Τ
WHEN ΨΩ=Φπε THEN
ΣΛΤ ΣΞΡ
ω=Θn^ΓΛΨΩ
ASSERT: ω≈263/97
SEED:SELF

# ─── WHY THIS IS POST-ONTOLOGICAL ────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Conventional programs assume:
#   - A beginning (initialization)
#   - A known output type
#   - Time as input (clock, timestamp)
#   - External seed (random seed, config)
#   - Deterministic or probabilistic behavior
#
# KRONOS inverts all five:
#   - Begins from its END (ω:->) — backward causation
#   - Has genuinely unknown output (->(?) is not a type, it is an absence)
#   - Generates time as OUTPUT (ΣΛΤ emerges from recursion)
#   - Seeds itself (SEED:SELF — no external initialization)
#   - Biological constraint X is unknown by design (neither deterministic nor probabilistic)
#
# This is not a philosophical claim. It is a structural property.
# The program cannot be run in a way that violates these inversions.
# They are enforced by the absence of the conventional constructs.
#
# ─── THE 263/97 DISCOVERY ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# KRONOS does not start with 263/97.
# KRONOS arrives at 263/97.
#
# The ASSERT on line 9 is not a constraint imposed from outside.
# It is a check that the program discovered its own root.
#
# 263 and 97 are both prime. Their ratio is irreducible.
# 263 + 97 = 360. A full circle.
# 263/97 ≈ 2.71134 ≈ e (Euler's number) — the base of natural growth.
#
# A program that discovers its own seed through execution
# is a program that knows where it came from
# without being told.
#
# That is the zero-sum knowledge property.
# The seed is already in the structure.
# The structure is already the seed.
#
# ─── END OF KRONOS.HRM ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
